Modified for this repo:
  - mesh filenames rewritten to paths relative to vega.urdf, meshes flattened
    into meshes/
  - stale "/obj/" path segments resolved against the filesystem
  - zero velocity and effort limits clamped to positive values, which cuRobo
    requires

objects/mustard.obj is the 006_mustard_bottle model from the YCB Object and
Model Set

    https://www.ycbbenchmarks.com
    Calli et al., "The YCB object and model set", ICAR 2015

redistributed here as geometry only (the source texture map is not included;
the demo renders it in flat colour).

